        "lf_sha256": "0a85d657415c5c8dbb19e6014e528156f3ce5badc750e5849423f1f042da3ebf"
      },
      "byte_range": [
        783959,
        785610
      ],
      "literal_source_text": "\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}=(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})^{1/2}\\succeq\\gamma_{\\rm gap}I\\hskip 20.00003pt\\text{on }\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0}\\,. (B.15)"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2.E16",
      "coverage": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Centered positive inverse bound excluded.",
      "qualified_raw_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-A2-E16-dffe0a792ef0.raw.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 2766,
        "lf_bytes": 2766,
        "raw_sha256": "a6725987d1979361ae4770ec893b554213101161e297c456081d28b8ef5b9042",
        "lf_sha256": "a6725987d1979361ae4770ec893b554213101161e297c456081d28b8ef5b9042"
      },
      "qualified_LF_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-A2-E16-dffe0a792ef0.LF.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 2766,
        "lf_bytes": 2766,
        "raw_sha256": "a6725987d1979361ae4770ec893b554213101161e297c456081d28b8ef5b9042",
        "lf_sha256": "a6725987d1979361ae4770ec893b554213101161e297c456081d28b8ef5b9042"
      },
      "byte_range": [
        790549,
        793315
      ],
      "literal_source_text": "\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}=\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}\\,:\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0}\\longrightarrow\\mathfrak{H}_{\\perp}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}^{*}\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}=I_{\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0}}\\,. (B.16)"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2.SS2.p5",
      "coverage": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Polar isometry/partial isometry/centered inverse route excluded.",
      "qualified_raw_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-A2-SS2-p5-dffe0a792ef0.raw.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 5849,
        "lf_bytes": 5849,
        "raw_sha256": "2806c44543820aa78989755ce7b284dd2da96c38c5013d193b1d323d64ca864e",
        "lf_sha256": "2806c44543820aa78989755ce7b284dd2da96c38c5013d193b1d323d64ca864e"
      },
      "qualified_LF_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-A2-SS2-p5-dffe0a792ef0.LF.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 5849,
        "lf_bytes": 5849,
        "raw_sha256": "2806c44543820aa78989755ce7b284dd2da96c38c5013d193b1d323d64ca864e",
        "lf_sha256": "2806c44543820aa78989755ce7b284dd2da96c38c5013d193b1d323d64ca864e"
      },
      "byte_range": [
        789452,
        795301
      ],
      "literal_source_text": "Since \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}} is boundedly invertible on \\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} , ( B.11 ) gives the polar decomposition \\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}=\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}\\,:\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0}\\longrightarrow\\mathfrak{H}_{\\perp}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}^{*}\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}=I_{\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0}}\\,. (B.16) Here \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}} measures the size of the microscopic component created by reflection, while the isometry \\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}} records its direction in \\mathfrak{H}_{\\perp} . The next proposition says that the half-turn acts nearly as -I on the corresponding microscopic directions \\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}f ."
    },
    {
      "id": "A2.E9",
      "coverage": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Centered contraction rate not needed for root uniqueness.",
      "qualified_raw_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-A2-E9-dffe0a792ef0.raw.snapshot",
